{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20127","headline":"送陆畅归湖州因凭题故人皎然塔陆羽坟 · 孟郊","name":"送陆畅归湖州因凭题故人皎然塔陆羽坟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淼淼霅寺前，白苹多清风。\n昔游诗会满，今游诗会空。\n孤吟玉凄恻，远思景蒙笼。\n杼山塼塔禅，竟陵广宵翁。\n饶彼草木声，髣髴闻余聪。\n因君寄数句，遍爲书其藂。\n追吟当时说，来者实不穷。\n江调难再得，京尘徒满躬。\n送君溪鸳鸯，彩色双飞东。\n东多高静乡，芳宅冬亦崇。\n手自撷甘旨，供养欢冲融。\n待我遂前心，收拾使有终。\n不然洛岸亭，归死爲大同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}